#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:7
#: ac4a251713ca4a6fbda95871bff004ab
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:9
#: 434c1dbfdb7a449eb9f62c625fb9214b
msgid ""
"对选定原子的 z 坐标施加表达式调制 `dz = f(x, y, z)`，然后将变形后的层按指定层间距和层数沿 z 方向堆叠复制。可选扩胞 z "
"向盒子和增加真空。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:11
#: 4a8a3381274a4a4895c9f721e236b66b
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:13
#: 01f9abc271a6445db1ee8a6b80a0d14e
msgid "场景：模型在多层异质结的层间耦合上预测失败"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:15
#: 300721fe58f44b5985df5a2d40a68b7d
msgid "你在单层 MoS2 上训练了一个 NEP 模型，单层性质很好。然后尝试跑双层 MoS2——层间距离预测偏了 0.5 Å，层间滑移能垒完全不对。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:17
#: 864e2018938446cfb2f585547eb98dc4
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 单层 MoS2 里所有原子都是表面原子（双面都有真空），但双层结构中层间区域的 S 原子面对的是另一层 "
"S，局域环境完全不同。训练集里只有单层数据，模型没见过\"上下都有近邻原子\"的层间环境。需要从单层出发，复制出多层堆叠结构。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:19
#: ba0e7c23d01145e494e3fb1e42d01e28
msgid "**输入：** 一个弛豫好的单层 MoS2 slab"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:21
#: b7307fdb565b483e83dee78a97a46afb
msgid "**目标：** 用 sin 调制给层加起伏，然后复制 3 层，层间距 6.5 Å"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:23
#: 85101086deeb495b96c85a8b89501ca7
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:24
#: 4ec1da81469843fab4181bd7110bc884
msgid "`Preset Index` = `1`（自定义 dz 表达式）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:25
#: 2b170360c3de4d0fb373d27a9518aa49
msgid "`Dz Expr` = `sin(x/pi) + sin(y/pi)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:26
#: acf00afef897487c87c2b0c81c44c181
msgid "`Layers` = `[3]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:27
#: 96aa4889dfa4468daee5f875c09ff369
msgid "`Distance` = `[6.5]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:28
#: 96dceff65e7e4394a7604f2ba256dd70
msgid "`Extend Cell Z` = 勾选"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:30
#: 0a5873d0729a4247a302ab261b60d1a2
msgid "**输出：** 3 层 MoS2，每层原子 z 位置有起伏调制，盒子高度自动扩展，带 `SWC(L=3,dz=6.5)` 标签"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:32
#: 334766f73b314f1ca2c857ea589b578d
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:33
#: 5e785ecbcdd64c3ebc0ce444ce4a4fbf
msgid "重训后计算双层 MoS2 的层间距和层间滑移能垒，应接近 DFT 参考"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:34
#: 46258e8092a24cbe960349eab411e8bb
msgid "检查层间是否重叠：最低层的顶部原子和上一层的底部原子距离应 > 2.5 Å"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:35
#: 88ae20f1cb7c4899a3ae428e336362ff
msgid "如果模型只对平整层好而对起伏层差，增大 `dz_expr` 的振幅或者换更复杂的位移函数"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:36
#: 94fd8353244a4058b661f6cc594ae470
msgid "如果需要构建多层异质结（如 MoS2/WS2），先用两张独立的 Layer Copy 卡分别处理，再拼接"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:38
#: a4de722e993549258dce745d1a3c7af9
