#: c1ab09076d5b46dfb2647493a690f096
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `sin(x/pi) + sin(y/pi)`。z 方向位移表达式，支持三角函数、指数等数学函数。可用变量：`x`, `y`, "
"`z`, `pi`, `e`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:61
#: 2eba82f53d594b3ab9fca40fcb924428
msgid "`sin(x/pi) + sin(y/pi)`——双向波纹，适合模拟热起伏或应变波"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:62
#: f07090349a6d4d49a77b6dd471ca6016
msgid "`0.5 * sin(x/3)`——单向正弦起伏"
