#: 875b7194313d41499a98db67929143b3
msgid "`bool`，默认 false。勾选后把复制出来的坐标 wrap 回周期盒里。大多数场景不需要开，保持默认就行。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:107
#: af48be396c6c443598c74e3c442a39b6
